# Options of the XiaoTai environment module. Each maps to the macro of the
# same name without the CONFIG_ prefix in
# include/xiaotai/modules/environment_config.h; the defaults here and there
# are the same.
menu "XiaoTai environment module"

    config XIAOTAI_ENVIRONMENT_HOLD_ON_SETTINGS_ERROR
        bool "Hold an environment switch when a setting could not be saved"
        default n
        help
            Off: when the storage barrier before the write fails (a setting
            write failed), the switch ends as failed and every gate is
            released at once. On: the switch stops in ERROR_HELD with every
            gate still held until it is cancelled (AT+EP CANCEL), so the
            device keeps refusing new sessions and setting changes until
            someone has looked. A timeout is never held.

endmenu
